  * same speed and the fling carried no information about the gesture. */
+/* Scroll acceleration, as on Apple trackpads: slow finger movement
+ * scrolls at the base rate (travel / divisor) for precision, faster
+ * movement gets proportionally more, up to DIGITIZER_SCROLL_ACCEL_MAX
+ * times. Momentum launches from the emitted rate, so a fast flick also
+ * coasts further and takes longer to stop. Speeds are filtered finger
+ * (centroid) speed in sensor units/s; logged scrolling on a Pavonis ran
+ * at a median of 3500-7300, with flick peaks of 14000-29000. */
+#    ifndef DIGITIZER_SCROLL_ACCEL_MAX
+#        define DIGITIZER_SCROLL_ACCEL_MAX 1.0f /* 1 = off */
+#    endif
+#    ifndef DIGITIZER_SCROLL_ACCEL_LO
+#        define DIGITIZER_SCROLL_ACCEL_LO 5000.0f /* below this speed: base rate */
+#    endif
+#    ifndef DIGITIZER_SCROLL_ACCEL_HI
+#        define DIGITIZER_SCROLL_ACCEL_HI 30000.0f /* at and above this speed: full gain */
+#    endif
+#    ifndef DIGITIZER_SCROLL_ACCEL_TAU_MS
+#        define DIGITIZER_SCROLL_ACCEL_TAU_MS 30.0f /* smoothing of the speed estimate */
+#    endif
+
